---
title: Spicy street potatoes
servings: 2
tags: [sichuan, chinese, vegan, quick]
cuisine: sichuan
time: 15 minutes
source: Chengdu spicy golden baby potatoes by Sichuan Kitchen, https://sichuankitchenrecipes.com/2020/07/11/chinese-street-food-chengdu-spicy-golden-baby-potatoes-%E5%9B%9B%E5%B7%9D%E5%B0%8F%E5%90%83%E5%B0%8F%E5%9C%9F%E8%B1%86
---

Halve any larger @potatoes{1%bag}(small).

Boil them in a #pot{} of water ~{5-10%minutes} until cooked through, then drain.

Chop the @green onion{1} and @cilantro{1}.

Heat the @cooking oil{2%tbsp} in a #frying pan{} and add the potatoes. Season with the @ground chili pepper{1/2%tsp}, @ground cumin{1/2%tsp}, @?ground white pepper{1/2%tsp} and @salt{1%tsp}. Fry ~{4-5%minutes} until the skins crisp.

Stir in the green onion and cilantro.

Top with @?chili oil{1%tsp} and serve.
